From d370e0922c7c915d1f175b7c944dd78d4780ed2f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shaan Majid <70789625+shaanmajid@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 20:14:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [cert] Update CA bundle to 2026-10-20

Updated from https://curl.se/docs/caextract.html. This drops emSign ECC
Root CA - G3, the root above the eMudhra intermediates whose keys were
compromised.

(cherry picked from commit 98d14a0cdcd9d765a34aa09ab51b6d7c2b189946)
---
 system/certs/cacert.pem | 941 +++++++++-------------------------------
 1 file changed, 214 insertions(+), 727 deletions(-)

diff --git a/system/certs/cacert.pem b/system/certs/cacert.pem
index a78e1dd..c5818b2 100644
--- a/system/certs/cacert.pem
+++ b/system/certs/cacert.pem
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 ##
 ## Bundle of CA Root Certificates
 ##
-## Certificate data from Mozilla last updated on: Wed Feb 11 18:26:30 2026 GMT
+## Certificate data from Mozilla as of: Tue Oct 20 13:32:40 2026 GMT
 ##
 ## Find updated versions here: https://curl.se/docs/caextract.html
 ##
@@ -13,272 +13,16 @@
 ## It contains the certificates in PEM format and therefore
 ## can be directly used with curl / libcurl / php_curl, or with
 ## an Apache+mod_ssl webserver for SSL client authentication.
-## Just configure this file as the SSLCACertificateFile.
+## Configure this file as the SSLCACertificateFile.
 ##
-## Conversion done with mk-ca-bundle.pl version 1.32.
-## SHA256: 3b98d4e3ff57a326d9587c33633039c8c3a9cf0b55f7ca581d7598ff329eb1f3
+## Conversion done with mk-ca-bundle.pl version 1.35.
+## SHA256: beb7e6dfe6499926e52c075c27bcfbe4c957f8609c575b3860273ae2806f63eb
 ##
 
 
